    {
      "kind": "git",
      "name": "srfi-64",
      "library": "(srfi 64)",
      "role": "measured",
      "url": "https://github.com/scheme-requests-for-implementation/srfi-64",
      "commit": "2d6a9fc514050f75802ef0003cfbf4846602a3ee",
      "measure": [
        "contrib/taylan.kammer/64.sld",
        "contrib/taylan.kammer/64/execution.sld",
        "contrib/taylan.kammer/64/source-info.sld",
        "contrib/taylan.kammer/64/test-runner.sld",
        "contrib/taylan.kammer/64/test-runner-simple.sld",
        "testing.scm"
      ],
      "note": "execution.sld and test-runner-simple.sld import SRFIs 35 and 48, which the corpus has as dependencies: SRFI 48's reference implementation through a wrapper (benchmarks/corpus/wrappers/srfi-48.sld), SRFI 35 from Taylan Kammer's collection. source-info.sld imports R6RS's (rnrs syntax-case (6)), so (srfi 64) itself cannot be loaded, nor the tests that import it. testing.scm, the original portable implementation, needs none of them and is measured as a program."
    },
    {
